%% Lab 03: the agent loop. The model replies with tool calls or with text (ink); our code runs each tool call,
%% adds the model's reply and the results to the messages list and checks the turn cap (lime), then sends the
%% whole list again.
%% Two exits: the model's answer, or our turn cap.
%% Export: npx -y @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli -i lab03_agent_loop.mmd -o lab03_agent_loop.png -b white -s 2
flowchart LR
    question[the question] --> list[messages list<br/>sent in full<br/>on every turn]
    list --> model[model replies<br/>tool calls or text]
    model -->|finish_reason<br/>tool_calls| run[our code runs<br/>each tool call]
    run --> result[reply and results added<br/>one tool message<br/>per call]
    result --> left{turns<br/>left?}
    left -->|yes: go round again| list
    left -->|no| cap[exit 2: the turn cap<br/>no answer]
    model -->|finish_reason<br/>stop| answer[exit 1: the answer<br/>the reply's text]
    classDef model fill:#0B1220,color:#FFFFFF,stroke:#0B1220
    classDef code fill:#C9F24D,color:#0B1220,stroke:#0B1220
    class model model
    class run,result,left code
